<title>USA: Group sells 7.1 pct Photran stake.</title>
<headline>Group sells 7.1 pct Photran stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group including Presidio Partners, a San Francisco-based investment adviser, said Friday it sold its 7.1 percent stake in Photran Corp, a Minneapolis-based optical products company.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it sold 345,000 shares of Photran on November 14 for about $3.8 million.</p>
<p>The group did not specify any reasons in the filing for the sale.</p>
</text>
